title: "Low-current MOSFET drift-diffusion verification benchmark"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-07"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24040429"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.24040430"
    description: "Zenodo DOI of version 1.0.0"
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.24040429"
    description: "Zenodo concept DOI (all versions)"
abstract: >-
  An open, code-agnostic reference set for the zero-bias (linear-response) terminal conductances of two-dimensional
  n-channel MOSFETs at low current, with published meshes, a scorer, a failure-mode atlas of terminal-current
  evaluation (including DEVSIM 2.11.2's default contact current and AC analysis), a pre-registered analysis of why the
  coupled small-signal solve fails and of the grid convergence of the references, and a pre-registered AI-agent study.
